+
+### `createPatch(from, to)`
+
+Computes a [JSON Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902) (RFC 6902) that turns `from` into `to`
+when applied with `applyPatch`. It does not mutate `from` or `to`, and the patch describes only the
+object members and array elements that actually changed, rather than replacing whole documents or
+containers wholesale.
+
+```ts
+import { createPatch } from "json-toolkit";
+
+const from = { title: "Draft", tags: ["a", "b"] };
+const to = { title: "Published", tags: ["a", "b"] };
+
+createPatch(from, to); // [{ op: "replace", path: "/title", value: "Published" }]
+```
